# CRM Contacts Feature Test Plan

- [x] Navigate to http://localhost:3000/#crm
- [x] Wait for data to load (3s)
- [x] Screenshot client list (verify contacts badge/info)
- [x] Click "✏️ Sửa" on "KABAM GAMES, INC"
- [x] Wait for form (2s)
- [x] Screenshot edit form (scroll to "Người liên hệ")
- [x] Click "+ Thêm liên hệ"
- [x] Wait for contact form (1s)
- [x] Screenshot contact form
- [x] Final report

## Findings
- Client list displays contact count and names correctly.
- Edit form contains a "Người liên hệ" section with existing contacts.
- "+ Thêm liên hệ" opens an inline form with all expected fields (Name, Position, Email, Phone, Primary checkbox).
